# voxely-runtime-acceptance

A wave that changes overlay HWND, DPI, tray/taskbar icons, native cues, or text insertion is not done until Windows runtime evidence or an explicit `BLOCKED`.

Vite/Playwright/jsdom does not prove WebView2 clipping, PE icons, or Unicode insertion.

Coverage that excludes the changed surface is not a pass. Do not lower coverage thresholds to go green.
